; Parchment text: string numbers of the two lines
;
; Set when a parchment is picked up (#R$A836 copies the two bytes after the item's coordinates), printed by the
; parchment script #R$832A through two PRINTVAR ops (script op $84). The image holds 25 and 26, the first parchment
; ("Twelve crosses / against the devil").
; .
; +0 byte ParchmentLine1: string number of the first line
; +1 byte ParchmentLine2: string number of the second line
@label=ParchmentLine1
g$850E DEFB $19
@label=ParchmentLine2
 $850F DEFB $1A
